    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ten seconds left on the clock. You have the ball. A fire breathing wyvern attacks \u2013 but you dodge just in time, thanks to a teammate\u2019s spell. A giant worm appears, ready to crush you under its massive weight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just another day in Field of Heroes \u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/222cf9821a15955cfd9a716488b602f8.poster.avif?t=1747936190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/222cf9821a15955cfd9a716488b602f8.webm?t=1747936190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/222cf9821a15955cfd9a716488b602f8.mp4?t=1747936190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drawing inspiration from Pigskin <i>621 A.D.</i>, <i>Rocket League</i>, and <i>Mario Strikers</i>, <i>Field of Heroes</i> is a real-time online spectacle that mixes competitive sports and visceral combat \u2013 but with orcs. A LOT of orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as one of nine unique warriors, compete online, create your own fields, and seek glory with built-in Twitch integration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to step onto the <i>Field of Heroes</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/89911df9c6fb2e6c98844b76331d67d3.poster.avif?t=1747936190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/89911df9c6fb2e6c98844b76331d67d3.webm?t=1747936190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/89911df9c6fb2e6c98844b76331d67d3.mp4?t=1747936190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Choose your hero:</i> Play as one of nine unique warriors, each with a unique backstory and skill set.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Bask in the attention:</i> Taunt opponents and revel in your audience\u2019s cheers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Create new fields:</i> Harness the Unreal Engine-powered Editor to add obstacles, monsters, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Compete Anywhere:</i> In online 5v5 PvPvE matches or single player versus AI. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gain Notoriety:</i> Track your wins with leaderboards and personal stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Become a Legend:</i> Use Twitch integration to invite your viewers \u2013 they\u2019ll appear as audience members in the stadium</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ten seconds left on the clock. You have the ball. A fire breathing wyvern attacks \u2013 but you dodge just in time, thanks to a teammate\u2019s spell. A giant worm appears, ready to crush you under its massive weight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just another day in Field of Heroes \u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/222cf9821a15955cfd9a716488b602f8.poster.avif?t=1747936190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/222cf9821a15955cfd9a716488b602f8.webm?t=1747936190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/222cf9821a15955cfd9a716488b602f8.mp4?t=1747936190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drawing inspiration from Pigskin <i>621 A.D.</i>, <i>Rocket League</i>, and <i>Mario Strikers</i>, <i>Field of Heroes</i> is a real-time online spectacle that mixes competitive sports and visceral combat \u2013 but with orcs. A LOT of orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as one of nine unique warriors, compete online, create your own fields, and seek glory with built-in Twitch integration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to step onto the <i>Field of Heroes</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/89911df9c6fb2e6c98844b76331d67d3.poster.avif?t=1747936190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/89911df9c6fb2e6c98844b76331d67d3.webm?t=1747936190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/89911df9c6fb2e6c98844b76331d67d3.mp4?t=1747936190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Choose your hero:</i> Play as one of nine unique warriors, each with a unique backstory and skill set.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Bask in the attention:</i> Taunt opponents and revel in your audience\u2019s cheers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Create new fields:</i> Harness the Unreal Engine-powered Editor to add obstacles, monsters, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Compete Anywhere:</i> In online 5v5 PvPvE matches or single player versus AI. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gain Notoriety:</i> Track your wins with leaderboards and personal stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Become a Legend:</i> Use Twitch integration to invite your viewers \u2013 they\u2019ll appear as audience members in the stadium</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Swords, sorcery \u2013 and soccer. Assemble your orc players in Field of Heroes, the wildest, most radical online sports brawler ever. Conquer existing fields or create your own \u2013 but do it as a team. Sharpen your weapons, focus your spells, and SCORE!",
